              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Home Fry"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I think there was an error in the measurement for the garlic salt, otherwise I would have given it 5 stars. Very quick and simple to make. I reduced amount of garlic salt and it had a great flavor. Especially the fresh black pepper with the pork."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeanie morrison"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Take heed to reduce the salt and spicy stuff. But quick and easy, flavor great. At the moment lettuce, cilantro and jalapeños are all suspect so this is great Mexican",
            "datePublished": "2026-08-11T19:22:15.750Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Well the name is spot on, this is definitely salty and spicy, to the point it is nearly inedible. The cayenne and onion salt amounts seemed way too excessive, but I went ahead with it anyway. I even split the spice mixture between 2 pork chops, instead of 1, and that was still way too much. This would be enough salt and cayenne for 6-8 chops, so really cut back if you’re going to make this. Thankfully once rolled into the tortilla with cheese and salsa, the saltiness was masked a little bit, but I still couldn't finish it, and I’m a salt lover.",
            "datePublished": "2023-01-06T14:10:09.824Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "marjohnal"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Nice for a change and to use up some pork chops I had laying around. Added avocado and onions and heated up the tortillas. Tasted fresh and satisfying but not sure it will go on my regular rotation.",
